265896175594_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z9W9RW6Dz0oQ7kNvwHZLp0_&_nc_oc=Adqk6oePhnxY5gATG4kyivbGgLKPtloxufbsQKPQwDu9WI1_3T6uRkm7lZkY1Hbfm8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKo6ABnNGr23rnDaQ3WoSjzp1sD1tUNfWlRhbbvuii7XQ&oe=6ABE84F8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Invictus: Men of Iron (Early Access)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Alpha Test Multiplayer maps\n\n\"Invictus: Men of Iron,\" is a VR experience that throws you into the heart of an arena or battle battle like a real gladiator or spartan.\n\nWhats to come...\n\nFeatures:\n\nEpic Battles: Engage in intense combat scenarios featuring unique factions, each with its distinctive armor and weaponry inspired by ancient cultures. Dynamic Environments: Fight in varied and breathtaking landscapes, from rugged mountains and dense forests to dramatic skies and stormy clouds.\n\nDiverse Warriors: Choose from a range of male and female warriors, each meticulously designed with ornate armor reflecting their cultural heritage.\n\nStrategic Combat: Utilize a variety of weapons, including swords, axes, and master different fighting styles to dominate your enemies.\n\nImmersive VR Experience: swing, block, and dodge mechanics in the works.", "short_description": "(ALPHA X -EARLY ACCESS - SANDBOX PHYSICS ARENA - MULTIPLAYER MAP 1) \n\nCOMBAT PHYSICS ARENA / MULTIPLAYER HACK & SLASHER"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mdrngames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MDRNgamesINC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sidequestvr.com/app/36450/invictus-men-of-iron", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres":